# HCI Studio — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in ONLY the keys you own.
# Never commit .env. Never paste keys into chat or code.

# Server
PORT=3000
HOST=127.0.0.1

# --- The brain (AI providers). Set at least one for the live brain. ---
# If none are set, the app still works for prompt-building from its
# built-in HCI knowledge, and it says plainly that the live brain needs a key.
# Keys are yours. Free options that need no card (checked 13 Nov 2026):
#   - Google Gemini API (AI Studio) has a free tier — a good place to start.
#   - Groq has a free tier, no card — fast open models.
#   - Tavily (below) has a free tier, no card — live search.
# Paid options: Anthropic (Claude) needs $10 of credits by card, no free
# trial. Perplexity needs a payment method (card) to create a key.
# OpenAI's key is free to create but new accounts show $0.00 credit.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=

# --- Live trending search (optional, needs a key) ---
# Perplexity (above) is used first. Tavily is a second option.
TAVILY_API_KEY=

# --- Image generation (optional, needs a key) ---
# Uses the OpenAI Images API when OPENAI_API_KEY is set.
# If no key is set, image creation says so plainly instead of pretending.

# --- Owner ---
# The FIRST account registered in the app becomes the owner/admin.
# No owner account is seeded here on purpose.
